# 15. Production Engineering Execution Contract — Version 2.1 Extension

**Purpose:** Convert the existing backend architecture into an implementation-safe, testable and recoverable engineering standard.

**Authority:** This section is subordinate to `REOS_CONTROL_CENTER/data/state.json`, approved architecture decisions, existing CORE ownership and the applicable Control Center task.

**Important:** This document defines backend requirements. It does not independently authorize a new task, change the current gate, approve a technology change or mark implementation complete.

