## 18.1 No false completion

The following are not valid completion claims:

- “Folder structure created, therefore backend complete.”
- “TypeScript compiles, therefore API production-ready.”
- “Python tests pass, therefore customer workflows work.”
- “AI responds, therefore autonomous execution is safe.”
- “CI green, therefore deployment is production-ready.”
- “A file mentions a feature, therefore the feature is implemented.”
- “A previous commit passed, therefore the current commit passed.”

Report implemented, tested, deployed and production-attested as separate states.

